 "remarks": "Welcome home to this beautifully updated townhome offering comfortable, open-concept living with an abundance of natural light. The renovated kitchen features granite countertops, tile flooring, and stainless-steel appliances, including a new dishwasher. It opens seamlessly to the dining area and generous living room, creating an inviting space for both everyday living and entertaining. Sliders lead to a private deck-perfect for morning coffee or relaxing outdoors. The main level features hardwood floors, architectural columns, a half bath, and hall closet. Upstairs, you'll find two generously sized bedrooms with spacious closets and custom shelving, along with an updated Jack-and-Jill-style full bath. A full-size washer and dryer are conveniently located on the second level. Additional highlights include one reserved parking space and covered parking. Ideally located just minutes from downtown, Metro-North, shopping, restaurants, nightlife, and public transportation, this turnkey townhome offers the perfect combination of style, comfort, storage, and convenience. Simply unpack and move right in! Please note: Cats in residence, be sure they do not get out...complex permits cats but does not allow dogs.",
